OL,3,GNEWSAReigniting Brexit vote will 'open
OL,4,Adoor to Reform'
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK Leader Nigel Farage says the
OL,7,FPrime Minister has "opened the door to
OL,8,FReform in the most extraordinary way"
OL,9,Fby reigniting the Brexit debate.
OL,11,FSpeaking ahead of a rally of party
OL,12,Fmembers in Doncaster, Farage said he
OL,13,Fwas "very surprised" Andy Burnham had
OL,14,Fdiscussed rejoining the European Union.
OL,16,FThe Prime Minister promised in his
OL,17,Ffirst Labour Party conference speech to
OL,18,Fset out options on the country's ties
OL,19,Fto Brussels. He later acknowledged this
OL,20,Fcould include an option to rejoin if
OL,21,Fthat is what public opinion favoured.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
